Z||000000||DaRkLoRD||11-11-1999||07:37 PM||||I ordered some info for the Car Audio section of The Fiero Project today.. unfortunately, when I got the confirmation I found out I'd accidentally ordered the kit for the 1988 Firebird instead of the Fiero... I'm trying to straighten this mess out now, hopefully I can get it fixed and will have the Car Audio section up within a few days... Planned info includes full instructions for installing various stereo equipment into a Fiero, scans of a booklet on general guidelines for installing stereo equipment, links to a couple car stereo magazines and books, links to some Fiero-specific car audio sites, and a complete list of all stereo equipment that will fit in a Fiero, courtesy of Crutchfield.||||reg||4
