Z||000011||DaRkLoRD||11-13-1999||04:52 PM||||Great news.. I got the shipping confirmation from Crutchfield this morning. (for the right kit this time!)<P>I should have the info in a few days, so the car audio section will be up a couple days after I get the kit. Need time to scan all the stuff, write up some stuff for the page, etc.<P>I think the next section I'll work on is the engine swap page. Anyone who has dropped a new engine into your Fiero, or done a rebuild, care to share some tips or instructions? (with pics??)<P>And to everyone who has commented on my site, I really couldn't have made the site without the help of the forum members. Thanks!||||reg||10
